    turnFlow: '1. **Ante**: All players post an ante. 2. **First Deal**: Each player receives 1 card face down and 1 card face up. 3. **Bring-in**: Player with the HIGHEST upcard (Ace counting as low) posts a compulsory bring-in bet. This is unique to lowballâ€”high card acts first and must bet. 4. **Subsequent Streets**: Three more cards dealt face up, with betting after each. 5. **Betting Order**: After the first round, betting begins with the player showing the LOWEST hand (pairs count as high). 6. **Showdown**: Best low hand wins.',
